; orchard_cliff_chimney.room - Chamine do Penhasco (design 04 section 3.6): a stone chimney from the arena down to the caldera.
; The fall (cols 1-5) is survivable and one-way. From its floor (top row 107) the exit pocket is reached only by wall climbing the
; climb shaft (cols 7-9, eleven rows, no ledges) over a wall whose top is nine rows above the pocket floor: the wall-climb gate.

[room]
origin = 0, 0

